cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AquaMonitor in your research, please cite both this software and the companion paper."
type: software
title: "AquaMonitor Research Platform"
abstract: >
  Complete source code for the AquaMonitor Research Platform — a suite of
  interoperable, zero-dependency web tools implementing the M0–M6 mathematical
  framework for heavy metal bioaccumulation and cancer risk assessment in
  canal-fed aquaculture systems. Companion to Uno et al. (2026), Exposure and Health.
